[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Undo and remove the engine oil filler cap.</p><p>Raise the car.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the engine oil in a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013469.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit a new engine oil drain plug complete\nwith seal and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Plug</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M22</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>6.4 - 7.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237608\">1084A10</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Raise the vehicle and place a container\nunderneath the engine.</p><p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the engine oil in a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013961.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit a new engine oil drain plug complete\nwith seal and tighten it to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Plug</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.7 - 2.1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Refill the engine lubrication circuit using\nthe recommended oil.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA 20K</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>If the vehicle is subject to particulary\nsporty usage, use the recommended oil for the engine lubrication\ncircuit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA RACING</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>For the optimum operation of the engine\nin particularly harsh climatic conditions (temperatures below -20\ndegrees C), use the recommended oil for the engine lubrication circuit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA PERFORMER</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><