hicle on the ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the engine oil drain plug and drain the oil.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the engine oil in a suitable\ncontainer.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014935.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place a new engine oil sump drain plug\ncap, complete with gasket, back in its housing and tighten it to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Plug</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>Crankcase sump side 1.7 - 2.1</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[64,127,0,"<p>Refill the engine lubrication circuit using\nthe recommended oil.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA TURBODIESEL</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>For the optimum operation of the engine\nin particularly harsh climatic conditions (temperatures below -15° C),\nuse the recommended oil for the engine lubrication circuit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA WR DIESEL</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.2</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[512,127,0,"<p>Refill the engine lubrication circuit using\nthe recommended oil.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA TURBODIESEL</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>For the optimum operation of the engine\nin particularly harsh climatic conditions (temperatures below -15° C),\nuse the recommended oil for the engine lubrication circuit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA WR DIESEL</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Posi